===Verb===
{{en-verb|ruffl|ing}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make a [[ruffle]] in; to curl or [[flute]], ''as'' an edge of fabric.
#: ''Ruffle the end of the cuff.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[disturb]]; especially, to cause to [[flutter]].
#: ''The wind '''ruffled''' the papers.''
#: ''Her sudden volley of insults '''ruffled''' his composure.''

